ecy with the increasingly difficult mastery levels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638510/extras/2fb901dda167b1d3d88bbbfd9211d46b.poster.avif?t=1785765005\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638510/extras/2fb901dda167b1d3d88bbbfd9211d46b.webm?t=1785765005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638510/extras/2fb901dda167b1d3d88bbbfd9211d46b.mp4?t=1785765005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638510/extras/ea0829d6fd54348165d56dc1b65b7ebd.avif?t=1785765005\" width=650 height=100 /></span><br>This game is a love letter to the games of my childhood, made with passion in 9 years in the little spare time I got by a single developer from Italy.<br>The music of the game is real medieval music, taken from the Montpellier Codex, rearranged by Luigi di Guida.<br>I hope you enjoy the world of Dotage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638510/extras/890a6cec25537dd402b4636d7e796801.poster.avif?t=1785765005\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638510/extras/890a6cec25537dd402b4636d7e796801.webm?t=1785765005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638510/extras/890a6cec25537dd402b4636d7e796801.mp4?t=1785765005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
