                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Oh my gosh I LOVE this game!! At it's core it's a fairly typical village sim, get the berries, chop the trees, yadda yadda. But a) being turn based actually works REALLY well. As an obsessive pauser when I play strategy games, just shifting fully to turn based actually works perfectly for me. b) The demands of the gods add so much interest beyond typical village sim monotonic progress, and can really make one playthrough feel unlke another.\n\nPlus it's super charming! I wish the UI was a little better, but it didn't stop me from enjoying it, and to be honest the in-game wiki is pretty great. Strong reccomend!",
